''Leagues V: Raging Echoes continues!''

==Changelog December 4th==
{{Collapsed section|18|CLICK HERE TO SHOW}}
'''Leagues V: Raging Echoes'''

* The [https://secure.runescape.com/m=news/leagues-v-raging-echoes---issues--fixes?oldschool=1 Issues and Fixes] blog includes all the hotfixes we’ve made since launch.

This week also brings the following coldfixes:

* The League area emote animation now no longer hides other animations.
* There was a bug causing both the Crush Hour Combat Achievement from Phosani's Nightmare and the Temotli Triumph CA for Amoxliatl to fail.
* The Treasure Arbiter now works with the master cryptic clue featuring Juna.
* "Complete all Combat Tasks" were not registering for VVardorvis, Leviathan, Duke, Whisperer, Araxxor, and Perilous Moons despite all Combat Achievements being completed.
* We fixed a bug causing the Jewelled Crabs at CoX to switch to the wrong attack style when using Nature's Reprisal, plus roll incorrect accuracy with the melee style.
* Players with Grimoire activated can now complete the Task for redeeming an Arcane/Dex scroll, as intended.
* Fixed an issue where players couldn't get hydra or araxyte tasks.
* Equipping the Corrupted Bofa now correctly completes the regular enhanced weapon Task.

And the following hotfix in case you missed it earlier this week:

* Using the Total Recall orb to save a Runecrafting altar in a Region you don't have access to was causing the inability to store new memories to the orb.

===Other Changes===

* Added a toggle for the minimenu scrollbar, which appears when minimenus contain more than 12 entries.
* Fixed a bug with the Rock Cake stall which prevented progress on the Watchtower Quest in main game worlds.
* The Rune Thrownaxe’s special attack now correctly deals damage when bouncing after being used on the doors of the Dagannoth Kings’ lair.
* The Infernal Axe now keeps its charges upon using the ‘Change-style’ option when ornamented.

===PvP Rota===
The PvP rota has moved to '''Period B''':

* 560 - (UK) - PvP World
* 319 - (US) - Bounty Hunter World
* 579 - (US) - High-Risk PvP World
* 561 - (UK) - Free-to-Play PvP World
* 580 - (US) - LMS Competitive

World 390 (AUS) for LMS Competitive has been <u>'''de-activated'''</u> with this rota.

World 569 (AUS) for Bounty Hunter has been <u>'''de-activated'''</u> with this rota.

The PvP Arena is using ''''Max/Med'''' loadouts in Ranked Duels and Tournaments this week.

