==Guardians of the Rift==
While our GOTR changes came in a few weeks ago, we did spot we may have missed giving a heads up about one of the changes. We know a couple of you were caught out by this so we wanted to share it here to clear it up.

* The minimum point threshold needed to get your hands on rewards has been raised from 150 to 300.

The threshold was raised to avoid unintended behaviour and abuse by hopping between worlds, contributing just enough to snag rewards, and moving on - disrupting the balance we aimed to create with recent scaling changes. The updated threshold should now ensure a more cohesive experience for everyone.

==Other Changes==
We rolled out our biggest-ever Mobile UI update last month! Among the many improvements, we introduced a scrollbar to the minimenu for entries exceeding 12. This week, we’ve also added a Settings option to toggle the scrollbar on or off, depending on your preference.

We’ve also made some general changes:

* Fixed a bug with the Rock Cake stall which prevented progress on the Watchtower Quest in main game worlds.
* The Rune Thrownaxe’s special attack now correctly deals damage when bouncing after being used on the doors of the Dagannoth Kings’ lair.

