Issue #2 of RuneScape's first ever comic series is out now!

Expanding on the epic tale of the God Wars Dungeon, this new comic book series delves into the Temple of Lost Ancients during the catastrophic God Wars – featuring iconic characters and Maro, an unfamiliar familiar trapped at the heart of the conflict, who dreams of breaking free from his master’s clutches.  A chance to escape leads to a thrilling journey for Maro when he finds allies – and enemies – across the front lines.

You can get a free introduction to the series, by downloading Issue #0 as a pdf from the [https://runescape.backstreetmerch.com/collections/books?sort_by=created-descending Merch Store] or [https://www.amazon.com/RuneScape-Untold-Tales-God-Wars-ebook/dp/B0DLBPWSZH Comixology ]for your Kindle.  For full details of all issues, cover variants and where to order, check out [https://titan-comics.com/news/how-to-order-runescape/ Titan Comics website].

